      "flavour": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Spectre is the reference UI for the kernel viewer. The shared viewer packages should stay aligned with the Spectre-iterated components, while host applications provide a Tailwind/theme layer that maps the Agent Prism token names used by the components."
